p in their everyday grind that they might as well be asleep. They brush off these deeply troubling connections as just some wild conspiracy stuff, thinking it's got nothing to do with them. But that's exactly how this cult-like network keeps going strong.\n\nWhen we're all just focused on our own little bubbles, we're blind to the big moves being made by these shadowy figures pulling strings of our civilization. By not giving a damn or looking closer, we're giving them permission to control us with human trafficking, blackmail, and worse. \n\nDark stuff. \n\nApathy as consent.\n\nIf they tell you what they're going to do to you and you don't object you are a consenting party.\n\nThis mess isn't just about some high-profile names or crazy stories; it's about the world we're all living in right now. \n\nThink about it - Please.\n\nWhen you're not paying attention, you're part of the problem, letting these networks chip away at our freedom, our rights, and what's right. \n\nEnabling the perverse puppet show of history we have agreed to accept lest we exit the cave.\n\nDemand that things change, support the good guys, and help clean up our society.\n\nThese mystery cults thrive on us not caring; your attention, focus, and action is valuable.\n\nThis is our reality, and we've got the power to change it.", 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 41, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Tue Jan 07 15:09:11 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1876647276996964607', 'display_text_range': [0, 274], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/hi5mXtNwjT', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/NachoQuixotic/status/1876647276996964607/photo/1', 'id_str': '1876647274937204736', 'indices': [275, 298], 'media_key': '3_1876647274937204736', 'media_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GgswwO9WQAABrrk.png', 'type': 'photo', 'url': 'https://t.co